 <a href="/compare/meridian-vs-churnzero/" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-slate-400">
 <p class="font-semibold text-slate-950">MeridianARR vs ChurnZero</p>
 <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Why MeridianARR replaces ChurnZero for teams that want support-signal churn detection built in, not bolted on.</p>
 </a>
 <a href="/learn/customer-distress-arr-risk/" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-slate-400">
 <p class="font-semibold text-slate-950">Customer Distress Index scoring model</p>
